6,52$Tubes and context brown, purplish black, orange, brick red or cinnabar red 
6,7$Tubes and context white, ochraceous, yellow to pale brown 
rem$ 7,70$Cystidia present in hymenium or context 
7,64$Cystidia present in hymenium or context 
7,8$Cystidia absent in hymenium or context
rem$ 8,75$Hyphal system monomitic
8,69$Hyphal system monomitic
