rem$ Basidiocarps sessile to resupinate; hymenophore hydnoid, lamellate, daedaleoid to sinuous ( Hymenophore more or less poroid, see 20)
22,0$Context dark sepia brown to black $Gloeophyllum
22,23$Context differently coloured
23,24$Context wood-coloured to pale umber brown; pileus present
