30,31$Spores negative in Melzer's reagent
31,32$Hyphal system monomitic
31,34$Hyphal system dimitic
32,0$Basidiocarp pileate; upper surface brown and tomentose; spores yellow to pale brown $Lenzitella malenconii
32,33$Basidiocarp resupinate; spores hyaline
33,0$Spores asperulate, less than 5 J.Un in diameter $Trechispora
33,0$Spores crested, larger than 5 J.Un in diameter $Lindtneria
34,0$Spores oblong ellipsoid, striate, longer than 10 !JIll; basidiocarp on Quercus, strictly resupinate; generative hyphae with clamps $Pachykytospora tuberculosa
