39,0$Skeletal hyphae dextrinoid; spores globose, finely asperulate (difficult to observe); generative hyphae with simple septa $Heterobasidion
39,40$Skeletal hyphae amyloid; spores cylindrical to oblong-ellipsoid, smooth; generative hyphae with clamps
