46,0$Basidiocarps pileate to resupinate; pore surface vivid orange red or pinkish fading to reddish brown, ochraceous or greyish black; trama thick-walled cystidia absent or present; hymenial mammillate, small, smooth cystidia usually present $Rigidoporus
