' Basidiocarps sessile to effused reflexed; hymenophore poroid; spores smooth; spores, cystidia and hyphae negative in Melzer's reagent; generative hyphae with clamps; tubes and/or context black, dark brown, orange to cinnabar red (Tubes and context white to pale cinnamon, see 60)
52,53$Tubes and context orange, brick to cinnabar red
52,55$Tubes and context brown to purplish black 
